# Intermediates: regenerable by the engine, not evidence.
#
# The narration is produced by `rasm tts` (needs the network for the edge
# provider) and the SFX track is rebuilt by the render.  The deliverable, the
# plan, the alignment, the approvals, the credits, the mix report and the
# evidence frames are all kept in the repository.
audio/tts/
audio/narration-*.wav
!audio/narration-norm--16lufs.wav
render/*.sfx.wav
